      "message": "docs(site): say what the browser version opens and saves\n\nThe front page and the First run page said that the browser version\ncannot open or save files. Since v0.20.0 it opens a model or a project\nwith the browser's file picker (#1314), and Save, Save As and Post\ndownload (#1438). The pages now say this, and name the file commands\nthat the browser version still refuses (crates/ui/src/browser_files.rs).\n\nFixes #1833\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
